{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "WitchRider",
    "steam_appid": 2642480,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u300aWitcher Rider\u300bis a tower defense game with RPG elements.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Background:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a world overrun by demons, gods have placed several altars to fight against the demons. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And you, guided by the altar, will take on the role of a hunter mage, slaying demons and protecting the altars. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2642480/extras/fd8e7b7c954bbccda6a5e25bff114d84.avif?t=1750432354\" width=614 height=526 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Rich construction facilities:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During the day, you need to build various economic buildings and defense facilities in appropriate locations based on the terrain.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2642480/extras/d55071ab25b61283902f0834611a68c2.poster.avif?t=1750432354\" width=618 height=354 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2642480/extras/d55071ab25b61283902f0834611a68c2.webm?t=1750432354\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2642480/extras/d55071ab25b61283902f0834611a68c2.mp4?t=1750432354\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each facility has its unique function, such as defense towers, armoured crossbows, various traps, walls that hinder monsters, terrifying bombs, etc. Building them properly will yield better results. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2642480/extras/f759aabb468784929ab92871f080e789.poster.avif?t=1750432354\" width=618 height=600 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2642480/extras/f759aabb468784929ab92871f080e789.webm?t=1750432354\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2642480/extras/f759aabb468784929ab92871f080e789.mp4?t=1750432354\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Distinctive weapons:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Close-range swords, medium-range spears, long-range bows, and magic-exclusive wands. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2642480/extras/cf8534312fc1466f75c955190617eaf1.poster.avif?t=1750432354\" width=618 height=628 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2642480/extras/cf8534312fc1466f75c955190617eaf1.webm?t=1750432354\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2642480/extras/cf8534312fc1466f75c955190617eaf1.mp4?t=1750432354\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Strange skills:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After protecting the altar, it will bestow you with divine blessings. It provides a rich variety of active skills and attributes for you to choose from, allowing you to create your own style and easily handle the next nightmare-like night. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2642480/extras/5c97b9177c45253b8bd84da69c44f7cd.poster.avif?t=1750432354\" width=618 height=392 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2642480/extras/5c97b9177c45253b8bd84da69c44f7cd.webm?t=1750432354\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2642480/extras/5c97b9177c45253b8bd84da69c44f7cd.mp4?t=1750432354\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Various monsters:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Monsters come in human forms, beasts, night demons, undead, etc. Their attributes vary; some are extremely fast, while others have extremely high defense. You need to be careful to deal with them. Defeat them or be killed by them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The night has fallen. Let's fight!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2642480/extras/bc1f467c799cd26e79b63d0badaa0137.poster.avif?t=1750432354\" width=618 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2642480/extras/bc1f467c799cd26e79b63d0badaa0137.webm?t=1750432354\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2642480/extras/bc1f467c799cd26e79b63d0badaa0137.mp4?t=1750432354\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Rich terrain levels:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forests, snowfields, deserts, swamps, and various other terrains for you to explore.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2642480/extras/0f187350d729707d083113d842a7f0be.poster.avif?t=1750432354\" width=618 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2642480/extras/0f187350d729707d083113d842a7f0be.webm?t=1750432354\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2642480/extras/0f187350d729707d083113d842a7f0be.mp4?t=1750432354\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deciding whether to build defense towers or civilian houses is crucial. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can freely combine various skills, and there are highly flexible skill schools waiting for you to create. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rich terrain and ingenious levels, the defense strategy is up to you. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >You will obtain:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At least 20 levels and no less than 4 types</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At least 20 skills</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At least 16 talents</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At least 4 weapons</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At least 4 sets of appearance clothing</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The gods will protect you, prepare to welcome the dawn, witch rider! </p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u300aWitcher Rider\u300bis a tower defense game with RPG elements.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Background:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a world overrun by demons, gods have placed several altars to fight against the demons. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And you, guided by the altar, will take on the role of a hunter mage, slaying demons and protecting the altars. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2642480/extras/fd8e7b7c954bbccda6a5e25bff114d84.avif?t=1750432354\" width=614 height=526 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Rich construction facilities:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During the day, you need to build various economic buildings and defense facilities in appropriate locations based on the terrain.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2642480/extras/d55071ab25b61283902f0834611a68c2.poster.avif?t=1750432354\" width=618 height=354 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2642480/extras/d55071ab25b61283902f0834611a68c2.webm?t=1750432354\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2642480/extras/d55071ab25b61283902f0834611a68c2.mp4?t=1750432354\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each facility has its unique function, such as defense towers, armoured crossbows, various traps, walls that hinder monsters, terrifying bombs, etc. Building them properly will yield better results. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_