187350d729707d083113d842a7f0be.webm?t=1750432354\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2642480/extras/0f187350d729707d083113d842a7f0be.mp4?t=1750432354\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deciding whether to build defense towers or civilian houses is crucial. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can freely combine various skills, and there are highly flexible skill schools waiting for you to create. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rich terrain and ingenious levels, the defense strategy is up to you. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >You will obtain:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At least 20 levels and no less than 4 types</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At least 20 skills</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At least 16 talents</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At least 4 weapons</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At least 4 sets of appearance clothing</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The gods will protect you, prepare to welcome the dawn, witch rider! </p>",
